From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ian MacDonald <ian@netstatz.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 01:08:05 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 5/6] build: no shallow clone of commit-pinned FetchContent
 sources

ANTLR (7d577039), MiniZip (aee7fbdd) and Minja (021c2293) are pinned to
commits but declared GIT_SHALLOW true. A shallow clone fetches only the
branch tip, so once the pinned commit is no longer the tip the checkout
fails ("fatal: unable to read tree (7d5770395bb7...)"); ANTLR already
fails this way for v0.19.0. Clone them in full, as stb and zlib are.

Assisted-by: claude:opus-5.5
---
 cmake/modules/fetch_content.cmake | 3 ---
 1 file changed, 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/cmake/modules/fetch_content.cmake b/cmake/modules/fetch_content.cmake
index cff5b5c3..f6d057ed 100644
--- a/cmake/modules/fetch_content.cmake
+++ b/cmake/modules/fetch_content.cmake
@@ -24,7 +24,6 @@ FetchContent_Declare(
   antlr_lib
   GIT_REPOSITORY https://github.com/antlr/antlr4.git
   GIT_TAG ${LITERTLM_ANTLR_TAG}
-  GIT_SHALLOW true
   SOURCE_SUBDIR runtime/Cpp
   PATCH_COMMAND 
     ${CMAKE_COMMAND} 
@@ -157,7 +156,6 @@ FetchContent_Declare(
   minizip_lib
   GIT_REPOSITORY https://github.com/domoticz/minizip
   GIT_TAG ${LITERTLM_MINIZIP_TAG}
-  GIT_SHALLOW true
   SOURCE_DIR ${LITERTLM_MINIZIP_SRC_DIR}
 )
 block()
@@ -175,7 +173,6 @@ FetchContent_Declare(
   minja_lib
   GIT_REPOSITORY https://github.com/google/minja
   GIT_TAG ${LITERTLM_MINJA_TAG}
-  GIT_SHALLOW true
   SOURCE_DIR ${LITERTLM_MINJA_SRC_DIR}
   PATCH_COMMAND ${CMAKE_COMMAND} -DTARGET_FILE=${LITERTLM_MINJA_SRC_DIR}/CMakeLists.txt -P${LITERTLM_PATCHES_DIR}/minja_patch.cmake
 )
